          "description": "A malboro seedling can breathe out a foul breath in a 15-ft.-cone. Creatures within the area of effect must make a Fortitude save (DC 13) or suffer a -2 penalty to Attack rolls and skill checks for 1d4 rounds. This is wisdom based save. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 1st level spell (Knowledge: Nature DC 17).",
